## Bringing it together

Towards the end, objects from earlier shots come together into one balanced stack: the yellow form, the glass disc, the pixel totem and the marble sphere. The split frame comes from a transition between shots.

![A split-screen frame of soft forms and glass](/work/warps-3d-motion/split-frame.webp)

{% gallery columns=2 %}
![Objects from earlier shots stacked into one sculpture](/work/warps-3d-motion/assembled-stack.webp)

![The stacked sculpture, a moment later](/work/warps-3d-motion/assembled-stack-close.webp)
{% /gallery %}

## Notes

This was an exercise in restraint more than technique. A few materials, soft light and slow movement were enough to hold each shot. Reusing objects in the final stack gave the piece a loose thread without needing a story.
